{"id":"n65249-3-7","stage":5,"title":"슬며시 · 悄悄地","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65249-3-7-1","ko":"이번에 상을 탔다고 말씀 드리니 부모님이 좋아하시지?","zh":"你告诉父母这次获奖的事，他们很高兴吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번에","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번에","audio":"/audio/46d83053c21d45a8f49f.mp3"}},{"text":"상을","meaning":"奖，奖赏","explanation":"상：奖，奖赏；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"상","audio":"/audio/3c2d6ddb4a94f1f36375.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62113","senseId":"1","lemma":"상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상을","audio":"/audio/8a9533d1c73ef1cf459c.mp3"}},{"text":"탔다고","meaning":"领，领取","explanation":"타다：领，领取；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91124","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"탔다고","audio":"/audio/89c9d5b2cc403e68909c.mp3"}},{"text":"말씀","meaning":"话","explanation":"말씀：话。","readings":[{"term":"말씀","audio":"/audio/9fa325aa12d3fdd01819.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27365","senseId":"1","lemma":"말씀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말씀","audio":"/audio/9fa325aa12d3fdd01819.mp3"}},{"text":"드리니","meaning":"给、奉上（谦敬表达）","explanation":"드리다：给、奉上（谦敬表达）；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드리니","audio":"/audio/590ef4763af22a0aea8a.mp3"}},{"text":"부모님이","meaning":"父母","explanation":"부모님：父母；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"부모님","audio":"/audio/068bccdcf866defe1ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62272","senseId":"1","lemma":"부모님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부모님이","audio":"/audio/7f3cf589d922be64a074.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아하시지?","meaning":"欢喜，高兴","explanation":"좋아하다：欢喜，高兴；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"5","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아하시지","audio":"/audio/39318cf098e432a455ba.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"3c2d6ddb4a94f1f3","term":"상","zh":"奖，奖赏","audio":"/audio/3c2d6ddb4a94f1f36375.mp3","entryId":"62113","definition":"为表扬做的好事或优秀的成绩而给的东西。","pronunciation":["상"]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"领，领取","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"91124","definition":"拿到作为份额或奖励的钱或物品。","pronunciation":["타다"]},{"id":"9fa325aa12d3fdd0","term":"말씀","zh":"话","audio":"/audio/9fa325aa12d3fdd01819.mp3","entryId":"27365","definition":"(敬语)别人的言语。","pronunciation":["말ː씀"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"给、奉上（谦敬表达）","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"61168","definition":"(尊称)给。","pronunciation":["드리다"]},{"id":"068bccdcf866defe","term":"부모님","zh":"父母","audio":"/audio/068bccdcf866defe1ca7.mp3","entryId":"62272","definition":"(敬语)父亲和母亲。","pronunciation":["부모님"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"欢喜，高兴","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"表现出开心愉快的感情。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d436ea3b321c728e0ab9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65249-3-7-2","ko":"응. 말로 표현은 안 하셨지만 슬며시 미소를 지으셨어.","zh":"嗯，他们没说出来，但悄悄露出了笑容。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId